{"list_html":"  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Naarea_2_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Naarea fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Ronnsquare is a professional company that respects its clients and truly listens to their needs. Their expertise in construction management is an undeniable asset that greatly contributed to the success of our fit-out project.&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Jean-Marc-Magnet-Naarea.png\" alt=\"Jean-Marc Magnet\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Jean-Marc Magnet<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Real Estate Director \u2013 Naarea<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_IM_Projet_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"IM Projet fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;What impressed me most about Ronnsquare was the quality of the relationship, the availability of the team, their responsiveness, and their ability to truly understand and address our requirements.&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Philippe_Regis_IM_Projet_200kb.png\" alt=\"Philippe R\u00e9gis\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Philippe R\u00e9gis<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">President \u2013 IM Projet<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Merz_Aesthetics_1_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Merz Aesthetics fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We were particularly impressed by the excellent coordination between the project manager and the talented architect, who delivered a project that perfectly met both our requirements and our desires&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nicolas_de_La_Hosseraye_Merz_Aesthetics_200kb.png\" alt=\"Nicolas de La Hosseraye\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Nicolas de La Hosseraye<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Executive Officer \u2013 Merz Aesthetics<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Niterra_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Niterra fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We would like to thank Ronnsquare and everyone involved in the project for their attentiveness and commitment throughout the process. It was truly excellent work&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Maxime_Vigouroux_Niterra_200kb.png\" alt=\"Maxime Vigouroux\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Maxime Vigouroux<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Manager \u2013 Niterra<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Niterra_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Niterra fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We have an office that is truly appreciated by everyone\u2014our employees as well as visiting colleagues. The feedback has been overwhelmingly positive, with many congratulating us on the success and quality of the fit-out&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Maxime_Vigouroux_Niterra_200kb.png\" alt=\"Maxime Vigouroux\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Maxime Vigouroux<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Manager \u2013 Niterra<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Groupe_Pharma_3_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"A pharmaceutical group&#039;s fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Ronnsquare embraced the challenge and delivered successfully: spacious and light-filled workspaces, excellent acoustic performance, and an environment that everyone genuinely loved. It was exactly what we were looking for&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Office_manager_Groupe_Pharmaceutique_200kb.png\" alt=\"Confidential\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Confidential<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Office Manager \u2013 Pharmaceutical Group<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n","pagination_html":"    <nav class=\"block-11-1-reviews__pagination\" aria-label=\"Testimonials pagination\">\n              <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--prev is-disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span>&larr;<\/span> Previous        <\/span>\n      \n                        <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page is-current\" aria-current=\"page\">1<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"2\">2<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__ellipsis\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2026<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"9\">9<\/button>\n              \n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--next\" data-page=\"2\">\n          Next <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;<\/span>\n        <\/button>\n          <\/nav>\n    ","paged":1,"total_pages":9,"total":53}